<title>MEXICO: Germany's Kohl to visit Mexico in September.</title>
<headline>Germany's Kohl to visit Mexico in September.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl will visit Mexico from September 18 to 21, the official news agency Notimex said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Kohl will seek to strengthen business and political ties with Mexico, Notimex said.</p>
<p>Germany will promote co-operation agreements for small and medium-sized Mexican businesses during Kohl's visit, a German embassy official told the Mexican news agency.</p>
